RedSpark includes the MiniCPM5-2B model files from openbmb/MiniCPM5-2B.

The model files are distributed under the Apache License 2.0. The model
license and upstream attribution are retained in
model/RedSpark-1.0-FlashLight-Preview/LICENSE and
model/RedSpark-1.0-FlashLight-Preview/README.md.

RedSpark-1.0-FlashLight-Preview's training, inference, and data-flywheel code is project-authored.
MiniCPM5-2B's Llama architecture support is provided by the Hugging Face Transformers
package (transformers>=5.6,<6).
